{
  "_comment": [
    "Stormwind's ambience, played by our own sound engine (.agents/docs/systems/evolutions-audio.md) while the",
    "player is in the city: passing sounds only, never a constant bed (loops felt bad: 2026-10-06) - the Trade",
    "District's square (a voice or a laugh now and then, children, pigeons overhead), the bank, Cathedral",
    "Square, the Dwarven District's forge at work (hammer, bellows), the harbour (gulls circling, a far fog",
    "horn), the park's birds, Old Town's dogs and cats. Kept in sources/stormwind: voices from the French",
    "client, the rest the game's or Ascension's (retail). The city's own fountains, lamps, banners and hourly",
    "bells keep their sounds."
  ],
